{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bio Goddess: Doomsday Begins is a third-person shooter survival game in which players need to play as a female high school student to survive in a school where a biohazard occurs. The tasks in the game include exploring various scenes, finding resources, fighting enemies, and solving various puzzles to survive. And investigated the ins and outs of the incident, and discovered the relationship between the incident and his father, and his own life experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2806120/extras/4e1df910b9db9eba334addbea8f97bb8.avif?t=1769518913\" width=600 height=312 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game uses cute female character designs. Players can obtain different school uniforms during the game, and each school uniform has its own special skills. These include school uniforms from different countries, hoping to evoke memories of school life. There are sexy enemy shapes as well as scary monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2806120/extras/867db072daa8dfb082533deb54992eec.avif?t=1769518913\" width=600 height=226 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game uses a third-person perspective, and players need to control the protagonist to survive in various scenes of the game. Collect various resources and upgrade weapons and character attributes (clothing). There are many puzzles to solve in the game, such as finding keys to open doors, cracking passwords, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2806120/extras/5259bcc670b75be1772bdc506cc86875.poster.avif?t=1769518913\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"ht